      "review_summary": "Adds read-only Windows Firewall diagnostics for LAN-bound Gateway status, setup/configure output, Control UI docs, and focused tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +899, Tests +841, Docs +4. Total +1744 across 14 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source inspection gives a high-confidence reproduction path: use Windows with `gateway.mode: \"remote\"`, `gateway.bind: \"lan\"`, or an explicit `--url`, and the new fast status call still invokes `inspectWindowsGatewayFirewall` from the local config. A focused unit test can mock the diagnostic returning a warning and verify the remote status JSON incorrectly contains a local firewall warning.",
